B. Multimedia (Camera and Images)
The Application requests access to your device’s Camera and Photo Gallery.

Purpose: This access is strictly used to allow you to set profile pictures for your user account and for your pets.

Storage: Images you upload are stored on our servers associated with your account. We do not use these images for any purpose other than displaying them within the Application as part of your pet's profile.

